WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:01,550
Can't delay any longer

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:06,400
We must go back before dawn, son

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,480
Hurry up

4
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:08,800
Don't you mean the lock pick?

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,800
Will it open as soon as you touch it? Don’t rush it?

6
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,000
They locked it from the inside. I'll try again.

7
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:16,730
Fortunately, my home is equipped with all-steel doors and insect-resistant locks.

8
00:00:17,130 --> 00:00:19,900
Ordinary door locks are no longer safe

9
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:30,340
The second floor is full of garbage and sewage. It smells bad.

10
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:34,390
No wonder everyone on the second floor has moved

11
00:00:34,630 --> 00:00:35,830
I can't stay in this place anymore

12
00:00:37,450 --> 00:00:38,770
In the future, garbage will also be put in the space first.

13
00:00:38,770 --> 00:00:39,690
Can't throw it here

14
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:44,720
101 family is so shameless

15
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:46,080
We let them live at the door

16
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,560
And let them come in to use the toilet

17
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,750
You actually stole our instant noodles and food last night. Do you have any evidence?

18
00:00:52,030 --> 00:00:53,230
He opened his mouth and said we stole it

19
00:00:53,670 --> 00:00:55,390
We even lost the things we left at the door.

20
00:00:55,590 --> 00:00:56,870
I also said you stole it
